01:19:37,060 --> 01:19:39,864
untuk menancapkan kapak itu ke kepalaku.

1335
01:19:40,605 --> 01:19:43,241
Atau aku akan pergi
dan dapatkan pacarmu dulu,

1336
01:19:43,291 --> 01:19:45,326
lalu aku kembali untukmu.

1337
01:19:45,459 --> 01:19:46,828
Oke?

1338
01:19:48,086 --> 01:19:49,622
Seberapa besar
kamu mencintainya, Sage?

1339
01:19:51,142 --> 01:19:53,376
Ayo, tunjukkan
seberapa besar kamu mencintainya.

1340
01:19:53,477 --> 01:19:55,479
Apakah kamu mau membunuh demi dia?

1341
01:19:56,671 --> 01:19:57,426
Satu.

1342
01:19:59,100 --> 01:20:00,767
Dua.

1343
01:20:04,287 --> 01:20:05,946
Tiga.

1344
01:20:09,926 --> 01:20:10,975
Sage.

1345
01:20:12,279 --> 01:20:14,180
Kurasa
kamu tidak benar-benar mencintainya.

1346
01:20:21,672 --> 01:20:23,640
Mau aku beri kamu
satu kesempatan lagi?

1347
01:20:25,492 --> 01:20:27,261
Aku akan beri kamu
satu kesempatan lagi, oke?

1348
01:20:27,369 --> 01:20:29,805
Tapi ini yang terakhir.

1349
01:20:29,939 --> 01:20:31,475
Oke? Oke?

1350
01:20:32,698 --> 01:20:33,800
Ayo lakukan.

1351
01:20:36,620 --> 01:20:38,255
Ayo, Sage.

1352
01:20:39,639 --> 01:20:40,607
Satu.

1353
01:20:42,193 --> 01:20:45,896
Kamu bisa! Ayo, Sage!

1354
01:20:46,981 --> 01:20:48,214
Dua.

1355
01:20:48,380 --> 01:20:49,983
Kamu bisa.

1356
01:20:50,374 --> 01:20:52,510
Kamu punya naluri membunuh itu.

1357
01:20:54,054 --> 01:20:55,488
Dua setengah.

1358
01:20:57,374 --> 01:21:00,243
Sial! Ya! Ayo!

1359
01:21:00,343 --> 01:21:02,245
Ayo, lagi!

1360
01:21:02,814 --> 01:21:06,316
Aku senang kamu tidak menyerah
tanpa perlawanan, Sage.

1361
01:21:08,310 --> 01:21:10,111
Apa yang akan kamu lakukan sekarang?

1362
01:21:12,172 --> 01:21:13,307
Sial.

1363
01:21:18,370 --> 01:21:20,471
Jalang sialan!

1364
01:22:56,243 --> 01:22:58,267
Sage!

1365
01:23:01,614 --> 01:23:04,050
Sage!

1366
01:24:17,341 --> 01:24:20,277
Diego! Diego!

1367
01:24:31,171 --> 01:24:33,907
Sage! Sage!

1368
01:24:35,342 --> 01:24:37,145
Sage!

1369
01:24:37,519 --> 01:24:39,031
Sage!

1370
01:24:41,331 --> 01:24:42,834
Kurasa dia tidak akan datang.

1371
01:24:56,554 --> 01:24:59,624
Hati-hati melangkah.
Hati-hati-- Aduh.

1372
01:24:59,758 --> 01:25:01,327
Tidak, tidak, tidak.
Kamu tidak harus lakukan ini.

1373
01:25:01,701 --> 01:25:04,138
Apa kamu bercanda?

1374
01:25:04,429 --> 01:25:05,597
-Tidak!
-Kamu tahu,

1375
01:25:05,738 --> 01:25:08,641
kamu pikir
kamu begitu sempurna,

1376
01:25:08,758 --> 01:25:12,829
padahal sebenarnya, kamu berantakan,
rusak, sama seperti kami.

1377
01:25:12,997 --> 01:25:14,664
Tolong, tolong, tolong.
Tidak, tidak, tidak!

1378
01:25:14,764 --> 01:25:16,300
Tolong! Tidak, tidak, tidak!

1379
01:25:16,400 --> 01:25:18,102
-Tidak! Tidak!
-Tidak, tidak, tidak!

1380
01:25:24,490 --> 01:25:25,539
Sial.

1381
01:25:52,403 --> 01:25:53,546
Kamu baik-baik saja?

1382
01:25:55,206 --> 01:25:58,117
-Aku... tidak terlalu.
-Ini, Sayang. Ini.

1383
01:25:58,316 --> 01:26:01,485
-Kamu?
-Pernah lebih baik.

1384
01:26:03,714 --> 01:26:04,715
Di mana dia?

1385
01:26:04,981 --> 01:26:07,416
Aku tusuk kakinya.

1386
01:26:07,508 --> 01:26:09,011
Dia terjebak di dermaga.

1387
01:26:09,945 --> 01:26:13,048
-Oke. Bisa berdiri?
-Iya, iya.

1388
01:26:13,290 --> 01:26:14,225
Oke.

1389
01:26:25,895 --> 01:26:27,396
Gergaji mesinnya mati.

1390
01:26:27,788 --> 01:26:29,356
Kita harus segera
keluar dari sini.

1391
01:26:30,598 --> 01:26:32,333
Kedua mobil sudah rusak.

1392
01:26:35,304 --> 01:26:36,805
Kita pakai perahu saja.

1393
01:26:37,330 --> 01:26:38,666
Oke.

1394
01:26:39,523 --> 01:26:40,760
-Oke.
-Bertahanlah.

1395
01:26:41,477 --> 01:26:42,469
Oke.

1396
01:26:45,889 --> 01:26:49,402
Aku harus akui...
aku tidak cukup baik.

1397
01:26:49,575 --> 01:26:50,666
Aku bisa menulis sambilan,

1398
01:26:50,691 --> 01:26:53,126
aku tidak seharusnya
berhenti dari pekerjaanku.

1399
01:26:53,847 --> 01:26:57,717
Aku guru yang baik, tahu?
Aku penulis biasa.

1400
01:26:58,636 --> 01:27:01,372
Aku ingin kamu tahu
aku akan kembali mengajar.

1401
01:27:01,422 --> 01:27:02,755
 -Oke.
-Oke?

1402
01:27:02,813 --> 01:27:04,581
kamu tetap
harus baca

1403
01:27:04,656 --> 01:27:06,225
tulisanku yang biasa-biasa saja.

1404
01:27:06,443 --> 01:27:09,042
Sekarang aku bisa menulis
tentang orang-orang rusak,

1405
01:27:09,087 --> 01:27:11,423
masa depan kita
tidak bergantung padanya.

1406
01:27:11,990 --> 01:27:14,026
Sial! Ke mana dia?

1407
01:27:16,769 --> 01:27:17,620
Sudah?

1408
01:27:17,695 --> 01:27:19,097
Iya.

1409
01:27:23,193 --> 01:27:24,394
Pegangan!

1410
01:27:24,495 --> 01:27:26,063
Oh, sial. Kita terikat.

1411
01:27:27,113 --> 01:27:29,781
Ambil kapaknya!
Ambil kapak sialan itu!

1412
01:28:37,125 --> 01:28:38,659
Mati saja!

1413
01:28:55,311 --> 01:28:56,479
Sage!

1414
01:28:56,595 --> 01:28:58,497
Mundur.

1415
01:29:01,525 --> 01:29:02,759
Sage!

1416
01:29:06,438 --> 01:29:08,140
-Sage!
-Nyangkut!

1417
01:29:10,666 --> 01:29:11,969
Sage!

1418
01:29:12,970 --> 01:29:14,305
Sage!

1419
01:29:18,642 --> 01:29:20,010
Mati!

1420
01:31:04,598 --> 01:31:14,614
